Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
L5PNs do not express large amounts of EB with known kinetics (Celio, \
Neurosci, 1990; Baimbridge et al., TINS, 1992); therefore, unknonwn EB is \
assumed; Assumptions: EGTA-like slow binding kinetics (biphasic Ca Signal, \
Lee et al., J Physiol, 2000, Schmidt et al., J Physiol, 2003); \
\>", "Text",
